Why the power supply of the LED display screen needs to be grounded - indoor outdoor led video display screen manufacturer Skip to content
Why the power supply of the LED display screen needs to be grounded
In order to ensure the stability of AC/DC conversion of power supply, according to the national 3C mandatory standard, the power supply manufacturer connects an EMI filter circuit from the firing line to the ground line in the circuit design of AC220V input terminal.
If more than 20 power sources are used, the accumulated leakage current can reach more than 70 mA, which is enough to damage the leakage protector and cut off the power supply.
Secondly, if there is no leakage protection and the LED screen is not grounded, the leakage current superimposed by the power supply will exceed the safe current of the human body, and the voltage of 110V is enough to cause death.
Summary: LED video display is the main component of LED and driver chip, which belongs to the aggregation of microelectronic products.
The working characteristics of LED display determine that its resistance to static electricity and abnormal voltage or current shocks is very fragile.
In order to use the product safely, the power supply of LED display must be grounded.
