Leon, Crow, Spike y Sandy They are the four legendary brawlers in the game, and getting them for free is a daunting task.
With a long range, it is of the sniper type, and is capable of containing and slowing many enemies at once. His main weapon are spike balls that explode and affect everyone around.
He focuses his strength on the poison carried by the 3 knives he throws and that damages his enemies little by little - an effect that increases the more times we poison them. It is very fast but has less hit points than others and has a low direct damage hit.
With his childish appearance, he is perhaps the most desired player since he is able to become invisible and get close to any enemy, at which point he hits him with a series of projectiles with great power and at a short distance. Damage that increases the closer we are to the enemy.
It is very useful for attacking and becomes a constant headache for opponents. It is also a great tank, a support character, and its "super", the sandstorm, is worth both defending and attacking, since while it damages enemies we can put our companions inside to heal them.
We are not going to lie to you there is no foolproof trick to get these characters, but there are certainly options. This is what you can do to increase your chances, or what can indicate that you are on the right track.
The first thing to keep in mind is that the more trophies we have more chances we will have a legendary brawler. So now you know, to win games, become the best and the game will reward you.
If you do not get new characters, do not worry, the game already takes care that if you have a bad luck streak, the chances of being touched by a rare brawler are increased thanks to the luck system. So that in the end, the legendary ones appear on your screen.
In order not to dismiss the article with a bad taste in the mouth and without having a magical way to get legendary brawlers, at least we are going to see how to get boxes and mega boxes quickly. Starting with the Brawl boxes, they are the most Basic boxes in the entire game, in them we can find new characters, strength points to improve the ones we already have, coins, gems and much more.
As a free daily reward:sometimes in the store in the daily deals, we will have a nice free Brawl box waiting for us.
On the other hand, the large boxes can only be obtained completely free of charge, collecting 10 star tokens, or by redeeming gems that we have been able to win in the store. Big boxes equalto open 3 normal boxes.
These are some tips to get the legendary brawlers in Brawl Stars. Have these tricks worked for you?
