Hydraulic jack is a product of classical physics. While we are amazed by human wisdom, it is necessary to understand the working principle of hydraulic jack.
The inside of the hydraulic jack is mainly a U-shaped structure where a small piston is connected to a large piston and similar to a communicating device. The hydraulic pressure of the large piston is increased by pressing the hand lever connected to the small piston to transfer the liquid to the large piston.
Lower energy transfer, under the action of Pascal’s principle, there can be an instant qualitative flyover, so as to achieve the maximum energy conversion. This is why a small hydraulic jack contains such a huge amount of energy.
Do you know how a hydraulic jack works?
When we use the jack, we must pay attention to the ground, as far as possible to choose suitable for the ground jack to operate. If the car is in the soft ground and there is no way to find a firm and flat road to fix the jack, we can put a large and hard support underneath the jack.
In the process of using jack, the lifting operation must be steady and slow. Because if we lift operation force too much too fast, it will be easy to get Jack deformation can’t even use scrap.
