The Hatakalin Car Mount is a simple oval vent charger.It’s sturdy with built-in magnets to keep the phone steady even while driving.Interestingly, the charging stand has a ring of LED lights to let you know the charging status.For example, if the charging pad has any debris stuck to the charger, it will glow red.
