News - After staying in the silicone industry for a long time, many customers will hear this question: silicone products with the same size or even the same structure have different prices.
Company news After staying in the silicone industry for a long time, many customers will hear this question: silicone products with the same size or even the same structure have different prices.
I was troubled for a while. In order to solve this problem, in addition to learning from the predecessors in the industry, I also bought silicone products of different prices, manufacturers, and regions for comparison.
Process: The diversity of the production process of silicone products will also affect the production cost. Such as silk printing, roll printing, thermal transfer, etc.
Mold: The number of holes in the product mold will affect the production capacity. Only when the customer demand and the number of holes in the mold reach a reasonable ratio, can labor costs be reduced and the cost-effectiveness of customized silicone products can be improved.
From the above, it can be seen that the price of silicone products that look the same will not be the same. It is related to the raw materials used, structure size, product technology, mold cavity number and order quantity.
